  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IGLHRC- R&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r homo-bi-transexuella                                                        personer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IGLHRC-Lesbian, Gay, Bisexual-, Transgerder Rights - IGLHRC - LGBT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IGLHRC&apos;s project is a continuation of earlier support. It aims at promote human rights and health services also for LGBT-persons in Southern Africa. The goal is to improve laws,policies and practices of Afrian governments and civil societie swith regards to HIV-prevention; and to increase the capacity of African LGBT activists and leaders to engage in effective HIVadvocacy</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IGLHRCs projekt &#xe4;r en forts&#xe4;ttning av tidigare st&#xf6;d. Det syftar till att fr&#xe4;mja h&#xe4;lsov&#xe5;rds- och m&#xe4;nskliga -r&#xe4;ttigheter hos LGBT-personer i S&#xf6;dra Afrika. M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att f&#xe5; till st&#xe5;nd f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade lagar och policies, och &#xf6;ka kapaciteten hos afrikanska LGBT-organisationer och f&#xe5; ledare att engagera sig aktivt i kampen mot HIV.</narrative>
  </description>
